        <mxCell id="XYuOb0B1FLeMS0J5-jVP-70" value="&lt;b&gt;How to determine overall lap status from sectors (visual):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- FlyingLap &lt;/b&gt;- status == FlyingLap (changes from sector to sector)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;- FlyingLapInvalid&lt;/b&gt; - status == FlyingLapInvalid (once a sector goes FlyingLapInvalid, icon doesn&#39;t change until new lap starts)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;- InPits&lt;/b&gt; - status == InPits (changes from sector to sector)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;- SlowLap &lt;/b&gt;- status == SlowLap (once a sector goes SlowLap, icon doesn&#39;t change until new lap starts)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;- Retired &lt;/b&gt;- status == Retired (once a sector goes Retired, icon never changes until session clear)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;- Finished &lt;/b&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;status == Finished(once a sector goes Finished, icon never changes until session clear)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
